This repository is the Cordis plugin host, console, agent bus, A2A endpoint and
auth layer that sits *alongside* Loams (https://github.com/ostrium-labs/loams),
the Rust AI-native data platform. Loams is a separate Apache-2.0, open-core
project: its metering, billing and other commercial APIs are proprietary to it,
and none of that code is present here. Nothing in this repository is compiled
from Rust — this is a TypeScript/Cordis codebase, and it vendors no Rust source.

